# Data & model artifacts (regenerate via `make data`)
datasets/cache/**
!datasets/cache/.gitkeep
**/artifacts/*.pkl
**/artifacts/*.joblib
**/artifacts/*.pt
**/artifacts/*.onnx
*.parquet
*.csv.gz
mlruns/
