# Keep metrics + reports (small, and they back the README claims)
!**/artifacts/metrics.json
!**/artifacts/*.md

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/

# Run logs
*.log

# AutoGluon writes hundreds of model files; its results are kept in autogluon.json
**/artifacts/autogluon_model/
**/artifacts/work/

# Task workspace database, created and seeded on first start
00_task_workspace/data/
